      ":question/problem": "The function $h$ is defined by $h(x) = ax^{2} + bx + c$, where $a, b$, and $c$ are constants. The graph of $y = h(x)$ in the $xy$-plane passes through the points $(-1, 0)$ and $(5, 0)$. If $a$ is an integer smaller than $-1$, which of the following could be the value of $a + c$?\n\n1. $-4$\n2. $10$\n3. $12$"
